      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "On agreeing to the resolution, as amended Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 225 - 187, 13 Present (Roll no. 102). (text: CR H2723-2724)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On agreeing to the resolution, as amended Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 225 - 187, 13 Present (Roll no. 102). (text: CR H2723-2724)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2750-2751)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H. Res. 1128, the Chair put the question on agreeing to the resolution and by voice vote, announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Thompson (MS) demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "The previous question was ordered on the resolution and the preamble pursuant to the rule.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H. Res. 1128.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 8029, H. Res. 1128, H.R. 5103 and H.R. 7084. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8029, H. Res. 1128, H.R. 5103, and H.R. 7084 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate on each measure. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 8029, H.R. 5103, and H.R. 7084.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-26",
        "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1131. (consideration: CR H2723-2731)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-24",
        "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1131 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 8029, H. Res. 1128, H.R. 5103 and H.R. 7084. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8029, H. Res. 1128, H.R. 5103, and H.R. 7084 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate on each measure. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 8029, H.R. 5103, and H.R. 7084.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-20",
        "text": "Referred to the House Committee on Homeland Security.",
        "type": "IntroReferral"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-20",
        "text": "Submitted in House",
        "type": "IntroReferral"
